--   Q2: B (index 1) — He submitted AI-written work as his own and did not disclose the AI use.
--   Q3: D (index 3) — Plagiarism: Kiran presents Sana's structure and findings as his own, and sharing a finished file made it possible.
--   Q4: A (index 0) — No, because she quoted, credited the source and added her own thinking.
